msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Taiga「You moron, Ryuuji!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Eres un idiota, Ryuuji!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Eh?!」"

msgid "Taiga「Where did you wander off to?!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¿A dónde te fuiste a vagar?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「W-Where......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿A-A dónde......?」"

msgid "Taiga「I'm asking you!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Te estoy preguntando!」"

msgid "Taiga「Where!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Dónde!」"

msgid "Taiga「Have you!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Has estado!」"

msgid "Taiga「Been screwing off!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Perdiendo el tiempo!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Ouch, ouch, ouch!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Auch, auch, auch!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh...... That's right, I forgot to let her＿know beforehand.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah...... Es verdad, olvidé＿avisarle de antemano.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「OUCH! You better hope I don't lose＿even more of my memory!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡AUCH! ¡Más vale que no me hagas＿perder todavía más la memoria!」"

msgid "Taiga「Be quiet! Go apologize to Yacchan!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Cállate! ¡Ve a disculparte con Yacchan!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I-I get it! That hurts! I said stop hitting＿me!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Y-Ya entendí! ¡Eso duele! ¡Te＿dije que dejes de pegarme!」"

msgid "Taiga「You some kind of stray dog, roaming＿around with amnesia!?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¿Acaso eres un perro callejero,＿vagando por ahí con amnesia?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「S-Stray......? I know where I live!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿C-Callejero......? ¡Sí sé dónde vivo!」"

msgid "Taiga「......Really?」"
msgstr "Taiga「......¿En serio?」"

msgid "Taiga「Cleaning...... Pfft.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Limpiando...... Pfft.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「W-What?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Q-Qué?」"

msgid "Taiga「Seriously, of all the things, cleaning?＿Hehehe...... \"Chores cured my＿amnesia\"...... Hahahaha!」"
msgstr "Taiga「En serio, de todas las cosas, ¿limpiar?＿Jejeje...... \"Los quehaceres curaron＿mi amnesia\"...... ¡Jajajaja!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Is it really that funny?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿De verdad da tanta risa?」"

msgid "Taiga「It's just, it's so like you, Ryuuji!＿Hahahaha! Heehee!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Es que eso es tan típico de ti,＿Ryuuji! ¡Jajajaja! ¡Jijiji!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Hmmm, Yasuko did call me a＿\"top-notch househusband\" earlier, but＿it seems that's how I really was.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Hmmm, antes Yasuko me llamó＿\"amo de casa de primera\", pero parece＿que así era yo en realidad.」"

msgid "Taiga「\"Was\"? That's how you are. Knowing＿you, I'm sure you'll make a man very＿happy someday. Pfft......」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿\"Eras\"? Así es como eres. Conociéndote,＿seguro harás muy feliz a algún hombre＿algún día. Pfft......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Very funny......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Qué graciosa......」"

msgid "Taiga「Hey Ryuuji, when you were doing＿chores, did it all start coming back to＿you?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Oye, Ryuuji, cuando＿hacías los quehaceres,＿¿empezaste a recordarlo todo?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「The housework helped a little, but......＿walking around outside and talking to＿people has helped more......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Las tareas de la casa ayudaron un poco,＿pero...... caminar afuera y hablar con＿la gente me ha ayudado más......」"

msgid "Taiga「Yeah......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sí......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Seems that way...... Oh, and hitting or＿kicking me won't help!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eso parece...... ¡Ah, y pegarme＿o patearme no va a ayudar!」"

msgid "Taiga「Oh, shut up. I didn't resort to violence＿for the fun of it, you know.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Oh, cállate. No recurrí a la violencia＿por diversión, ¿sabes?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh really?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Ah, sí?」"

msgid "Taiga「......What?」"
msgstr "Taiga「......¿Qué?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「N-No, it's nothing!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡N-No, no es nada!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（W-What was that!? Am I seeing things?＿I thought I saw something ridiculously＿ominous behind her!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¡¿Q-Qué fue eso?! ¿Estoy alucinando?＿¡Creí ver algo terriblemente siniestro＿detrás de ella!）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（A-At any rate, it seems it's best not to＿upset her too much......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（E-En todo caso, parece que es mejor＿no hacerla enojar demasiado......）」"

msgid "Taiga「Hmph, don't flip out...... Wait. Come to＿think of it, you remember my name,＿don't you?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Jum, no te alteres...... Espera.＿Ahora que lo pienso, te acuerdas＿de mi nombre, ¿verdad?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「T-Taiga...... right?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「T-Taiga...... ¿cierto?」"

msgid "Taiga「......Good.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Bien.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uhh, err...... Shouldn't I use an＿honorific? Although, I do get the＿feeling that I know you pretty well.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ehh, ehm...... ¿No debería usar un＿honorífico? Aunque tengo la sensación＿de que te conozco bastante bien.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「M-Master?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿A-Ama?」"

msgid "Taiga「That's right. You're my dog.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Así es. Eres mi perro.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh?」"

msgid "Taiga「Helpless mongrel that you are, you're＿my servant dog.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Como el mestizo inútil que eres,＿eres mi perro sirviente.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......I feel like I've heard that before.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Creo que ya he oído eso antes.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Uh, excuse you.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Eh, oye, más respeto.」"

msgid "Taiga「Oh crap! I have to call Yacchan and tell＿her I found the stray一 I mean, Ryuuji.＿Sit! Stay!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Oh, rayos! Tengo que llamar a Yacchan＿y decirle que encontré al callejero一＿digo, a Ryuuji. ¡Siéntate! ¡Quieto!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uh...... S-Stray......? Mongrel......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eh...... ¿C-Callejero......?＿¿Mestizo......?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......Who am I really?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......¿Quién soy yo en realidad?）」"

msgid "Taiga「Sorry for the wait. I'll have you＿apologize properly to Yacchan later.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Perdón por la espera. Más tarde haré＿que te disculpes bien con Yacchan.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Sure thing.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Claro que sí.」"

msgid "Taiga「You, you probably don't...... have plans＿later, huh?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Tú, probablemente no...... tengas＿planes más tarde, ¿verdad?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well, not really, no.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno, la verdad es que no.」"

msgid "Taiga「Then I'll have you accompany me.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Entonces haré que me acompañes.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Didn't you come here to take me＿home?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Acaso no viniste para llevarme a casa?」"

msgid "Taiga「Didn't you say you needed to walk all＿around to get your memories back?＿Less talking, more doing.」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿No dijiste que necesitabas caminar＿por todos lados para recuperar la＿memoria? Menos charla y más acción.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（I don't think I said it like that......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（No creo haberlo dicho así......）」"

msgid "Taiga「Well, I already told Yacchan you'd be＿out past dark.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Bueno, ya le dije a Yacchan que＿volverías después del anochecer.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh yeah, can I ask you something?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, por cierto, ¿puedo preguntarte algo?」"

msgid "Taiga「What?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Qué?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「How do you and Yacchan...... I mean,＿Yasuko know each other?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿De qué se conocen Yacchan......＿digo, Yasuko y tú?」"

msgid "Taiga「What...... what do you mean?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Qué...... a qué te refieres?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You said you're my master, but I live＿with Yasuko as a house-husband...... so＿what's the story?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Dijiste que eres mi ama, pero＿vivo con Yasuko como amo de casa......＿¿cómo encaja eso?」"

msgid "Taiga「I see. We're your co-owners, I suppose.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ya veo. Somos tus codueñas, supongo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......I don't get it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......No lo entiendo.」"

msgid "Taiga「Oh, are you really that confused?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Oh, ¿de verdad estás tan confundido?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, a little.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, un poco.」"

msgid "Taiga「I guess that makes sense...... Fine. I'll＿explain everything.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Supongo que tiene sentido......＿Bien. Te lo explicaré todo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Oh, please do.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Ah, por favor.」"

msgid "Taiga「Truth is, you could say I'm indebted to＿you and Yacchan. It's kind of＿mortifying, but it's an undeniable fact.」"
msgstr "Taiga「La verdad, podría decirse que estoy en＿deuda contigo y con Yacchan. Es algo＿humillante, pero es un hecho innegable.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Is that so?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Ah, sí?」"

msgid "Taiga「We started as neighbors, but since＿spring of this year, you've cooked for＿me and done my chores.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Empezamos como vecinos, pero desde la＿primavera de este año me has cocinado＿y has hecho mis quehaceres.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......」"

msgid "Taiga「Thanks to you, I've been able to live a＿normal, decent life...... Yeah, that's a＿fact, no doubt about it.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Gracias a ti, he podido llevar una＿vida normal y decente...... Sí, ese＿es un hecho, sin lugar a dudas.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I see.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ya veo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Is it that serious?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Tan grave es?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「O-Oh!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿O-Oh?!」"

msgid "Taiga「Therefore, I've decided to have you＿meet people, so that Yacchan and I＿can continue to live comfortably.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Por lo tanto, decidí llevarte a ver a＿algunas personas para que Yacchan y yo＿sigamos viviendo cómodamente.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh? Meet who?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh? ¿Ver a quién?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「C-Coming!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Y-Ya voy!」"

msgid "Taiga「The second we take our eyes off you,＿you disappear! You made Yacchan cry!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Te pierdes en cuanto no te vemos!＿¡Hiciste llorar a Yacchan!」"

msgid "Taiga「She was so happy you were finally＿discharged! Useless, vapid, stupid＿Ryuuji!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Estaba tan feliz de que por fin＿te dieran el alta! ¡Inútil, hueco＿y estúpido Ryuuji!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, really. When I was cleaning the＿house earlier, for the first time I really＿felt like it was my home.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, en serio. Cuando estuve limpiando＿la casa hace rato, por primera vez sentí＿de verdad que era mi hogar.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I remembered the address, too.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「También recordé la dirección.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Like, I did meet a few people who＿seemed to know me, but I didn't tell＿them about my amnesia.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Por ejemplo, me topé con algunas＿personas que parecían conocerme, pero＿no les conté lo de mi amnesia.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「So I didn't really know what they were＿talking about......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Así que en realidad no sabía de＿qué me estaban hablando......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Just from doing that, I keep getting＿these fuzzy images in the back of my＿mind.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Con solo hacer eso, me siguen＿viniendo imágenes borrosas＿al fondo de la mente.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I have a hunch that they're the clues＿to regaining my memories.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Tengo el presentimiento de que son las＿pistas para recuperar mis recuerdos.」"

msgid "Taiga「Really? Hmmm～ So, in order to＿stimulate your brain, you......」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿En serio? Hmmm～ Entonces, para＿estimular tu cerebro, tú......」"

msgid "Taiga「You should just walk around and talk＿to everyone you meet?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Solo tienes que caminar por ahí y＿hablar con todos los que te cruces?」"

msgid "Taiga「......I'll allow it JUST - FOR - NOW.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Lo permitiré SOLO - POR - AHORA.」"

msgid "Taiga「Consider it a reward for having firmly＿carved your master's name into that＿tiny brain of yours.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Considéralo un premio por haberte＿grabado bien el nombre de tu ama＿en ese diminuto cerebro tuyo.」"

msgid "Taiga「That's right. It took forever to train＿you. *Sigh* Now I have to start from＿scratch!」"
msgstr "Taiga「Así es. Me costó una eternidad＿entrenarte. *Suspiro* ¡Ahora tengo＿que empezar de cero!」"

msgid "Taiga「Hmph! It couldn't possibly get more＿annoying than this!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Jum! ¡No podría haber nada＿más molesto que esto!」"

msgid "Taiga「So Ryuuji...... We need you to turn back＿to normal fast, or me and Yacchan will＿be in a pinch. It's a life or death cu-」"
msgstr "Taiga「Así que Ryuuji...... Vuelve pronto＿a ser el de antes o Yacchan y yo＿estaremos en apuros.」"

msgid "Taiga「cur- CRISIS.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Es de vida o muerte, una＿cri- cri- CRISIS.」"

msgid "Taiga「Of course! That's why, above all, you＿need your household perception back!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Por supuesto! ¡Por eso, ante todo,＿debes recuperar tu sentido doméstico!」"

msgid "Taiga「Otherwise me and Yacchan will deviate＿from society, be ostracized, and fall＿into despair!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Si no, Yacchan y yo nos apartaremos＿de la sociedad, seremos marginadas y＿caeremos en la desesperación!」"

msgid "Taiga「You'll know when you get there. The＿way you are now, this will get you＿going more than anything, I bet......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ya lo sabrás cuando lleguemos. Tal＿como estás ahora, apuesto a que esto＿te animará más que nada......」"

msgid "Taiga「Anyway, we're going, so don't＿dilly-dally, you lazy dog!」"
msgstr "Taiga「En fin, ya nos vamos, ¡así que＿no te demores, perro flojo!」"
